              "text": "What they heard"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Cold-start rattle"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "A brief 2-3 second rattle after ignition, then the engine quietened."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "MOT flagged"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Engine noise - investigate"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The tester specifically warned that the timing chain sounded loose."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Final moment"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Crack, silence, dash lights"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "At 20mph, the timing jumped and the engine lost all power."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "If your Ingenium diesel rattles on cold start or an MOT flags engine noise, treat it as urgent. A £2,400-£3,000 preventative chain job can avoid a £4,500+ top-end rebuild."
